    "atom::4b42c6910a5ab5e3934dd15b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4b42c6910a5ab5e3934dd15b",
      "source_handle": "P0010",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）已改变晚期黑色素瘤的治疗格局，但青少年及年轻成人（AYA）群体在此类治疗中的生存获益历史上低于其他年龄段，且关于该特定人群肠道微生物组对ICI疗效影响的研究匮乏。本研究试图明确AYA患者肠道微生物组的独特特征，以解释潜在的疗效差异并为个性化治疗提供依据。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d048fc8c86ce8b8c9fe9ad12303ce07d02ba6d5bbb0",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::85b2ae9d437b47707c3c9cf61f155b91883177b601dee59124a3741c3741293b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::c5ab529a33fc4aa7c0ba1ad7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c5ab529a33fc4aa7c0ba1ad7",
      "source_handle": "P0010",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "研究对象为15-39岁的青少年及年轻成人（AYA）黑色素瘤患者，以及50-70岁的老年非AYA患者。研究情境为接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗的晚期黑色素瘤患者。数据来源为2021年《Science》发表的一项研究的回顾性队列数据。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d048fc8c86ce8b8c9fe9ad12303ce07d02ba6d5bbb0",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3a337f4f9cb99c24495b23efa7814aed328ba8077c5b636b37fc19a5ad69b4f1",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::621c238c42151ca1082b6986": {
      "atom_id": "atom::621c238c42151ca1082b6986",
      "source_handle": "P0010",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在比较AYA与老年黑色素瘤患者在接受免疫检查点抑制剂治疗前的肠道微生物组特征差异。研究从既往大型研究中提取了23名AYA患者，并按2:1比例匹配了46名老年患者作为对照。在控制了性别、BMI、种族、疾病分期等混杂因素后，通过测序数据分析两组间的微生物多样性及特定菌属丰度。研究发现两组间整体多样性无显著差异，但物种组成存在显著不同：老年组中富集了随年龄增长而增加的Ruminococcaceae科及与肥胖相关的Blautia和Dorea属细菌，而AYA组中Bacteroides stercoris丰度较高。结论指出AYA与老年患者的肠道菌群特征存在本质差异，提示针对AYA人群的微生物调节策略需区别于老年人。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d048fc8c86ce8b8c9fe9ad12303ce07d02ba6d5bbb0",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e59971bfbda8fe8b199f2efe3480fd4381e30bc46196a7042e575fc78871ba80",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::fdb5b8888a97a1eebb836436": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fdb5b8888a97a1eebb836436",
      "source_handle": "P0010",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文提供了青少年及年轻成人（AYA）黑色素瘤患者肠道微生物组的基线特征数据，并与老年患者进行了对比。对于综述而言，其核心价值在于揭示了“年龄/发育阶段”这一宿主因素如何塑造肠道菌群结构，从而可能影响免疫治疗的响应基础。它不直接回答机制问题，但为解释为何不同年龄段患者对ICI反应不同提供了重要的背景变量和潜在的生物标志物线索。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d048fc8c86ce8b8c9fe9ad12303ce07d02ba6d5bbb0",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::66e2526fe5e0f81f573538e1a2bce06452977b3edbe70f53149acf586064dbe4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::b90473264289de79142d0882": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b90473264289de79142d0882",
      "source_handle": "P0010",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅描述基线特征，未直接关联临床结局（如生存期或缓解率）。不能直接证明这些菌群差异导致了疗效差异，只能说明存在相关性或潜在风险因素。",
        "contribution": "提供了AYA与老年黑色素瘤患者肠道菌群组成的基线差异数据。具体显示AYA患者富含Bacteroides stercoris，而老年患者富含Ruminococcaceae及Blautia/Dorea属。这有助于解释不同年龄组患者微环境的基础差异，进而可能影响ICI疗效。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d048fc8c86ce8b8c9fe9ad12303ce07d02ba6d5bbb0",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::36ecea9ecfdb50811955154a916e4329e5cc03450db0220776355f13f5fc9b4b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::bae9af91f687c71ebf04d690": {
      "atom_id": "atom::bae9af91f687c71ebf04d690",
      "source_handle": "P0010",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于综述中讨论宿主年龄/发育阶段对肠道菌群的影响，作为解释不同人群ICI疗效异质性的背景因素。可用于支持“需针对不同年龄层制定个性化微生物干预策略”的观点。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d048fc8c86ce8b8c9fe9ad12303ce07d02ba6d5bbb0",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2f93250e177f6746dd84087e7996ba99495c7da824317c8bbe96fcfe936c41e6",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::91f62d029f6d062893eab747": {
      "atom_id": "atom::91f62d029f6d062893eab747",
      "source_handle": "P0010",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "机制推断较弱。虽然提到B. stercoris与纤维摄入相关，但未在本文中进行因果验证。不能据此断定菌群差异是疗效差异的唯一机制。",
        "contribution": "指出了AYA与老年患者菌群结构的显著不同，特别是涉及膳食纤维代谢相关菌种（Bacteroides stercoris与纤维摄入正相关）的差异。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d048fc8c86ce8b8c9fe9ad12303ce07d02ba6d5bbb0",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::36ecea9ecfdb50811955154a916e4329e5cc03450db0220776355f13f5fc9b4b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d12cbb87e778e3bc704fa1f7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d12cbb87e778e3bc704fa1f7",
      "source_handle": "P0010",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "在讨论机制时，可作为“饮食-菌群-免疫”轴在不同年龄组表现不同的例证。例如，若综述涉及饮食干预，可引用此结果说明为何针对老年人的高纤维建议可能不完全适用于AYA，或需调整菌株选择。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::a748856a6b0d4ee03d4b7d048fc8c86ce8b8c9fe9ad12303ce07d02ba6d5bbb0",
          "field_path": [
