    "atom::82c1049c351f6660caa30818": {
      "atom_id": "atom::82c1049c351f6660caa30818",
      "source_handle": "P0439",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "解决ICIs在大多数结直肠癌患者（尤其是MSS/pMMR型）中疗效有限的问题，探索如何通过调节肠道微生物组来克服免疫治疗耐药性，并识别相关的安全隐患。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::00ae381a8034efc1a09ecfba7f2db97f097122981f23691eb955bf881c3494e2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0e2e39b784263db7e091d4514f74c1fe26738f99365ef7cfbdad94d6432d919c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::edd6329a6caa52f247dce0af": {
      "atom_id": "atom::edd6329a6caa52f247dce0af",
      "source_handle": "P0439",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "结直肠癌（CRC）患者，特别是微卫星稳定/错配修复 proficient (MSS/pMMR) 亚型；聚焦肠道微生物组对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）疗效的影响及基于微生物组的干预策略。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::00ae381a8034efc1a09ecfba7f2db97f097122981f23691eb955bf881c3494e2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::16a8fb805ba50a6f4efa647e30d6b12b5e8dbcfaf60e2ea0a5d7fdffadfc9195",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::3e4a05237cb42d6954c814b0": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3e4a05237cb42d6954c814b0",
      "source_handle": "P0439",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "这是一篇叙事性综述，旨在总结肠道微生物组在结直肠癌发生、发展及免疫治疗反应中的作用机制，并评估益生菌、粪菌移植（FMT）、饮食调节和传统药物等微生物组干预措施作为ICIs辅助治疗的潜力与安全性。文章指出，尽管微生物组调控在临床前模型中显示出增强抗肿瘤免疫的潜力，但现有证据存在不一致性且缺乏大规模临床试验支持，因此强调需要标准化的方法和更严谨的临床验证。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::00ae381a8034efc1a09ecfba7f2db97f097122981f23691eb955bf881c3494e2",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::00ba84b2127a21cbf8f40f2a394e41e0bb7355f9c99e9495c287299f293144ab",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::10989374a21315d00fde5aba": {
      "atom_id": "atom::10989374a21315d00fde5aba",
      "source_handle": "P0439",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为理解肠道微生物组如何调节实体瘤（特别是结直肠癌）中的免疫检查点抑制剂疗效提供了详细的机制框架和干预手段清单。它特别强调了MSS/pMMR这一难治亚型的微生物组特征，并区分了不同微生物群（有益菌vs病原体）对免疫微环境的相反作用。对于综述而言，其价值在于整合了从分子机制到临床转化的多层次证据，并指出了当前领域的不一致性和安全挑战，可作为构建“微生物组-免疫治疗”相互作用章节的重要背景素材和机制解释来源。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::00ae381a8034efc1a09ecfba7f2db97f097122981f23691eb955bf881c3494e2",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b68690bac45f119dd8e219891854a09a8cd485bbc1f2777b4f06fe37194eb372",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::ebd11b917309870a1c077e6e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ebd11b917309870a1c077e6e",
      "source_handle": "P0439",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "证据主要来自小鼠模型和小规模人类研究，缺乏大规模随机对照试验的直接因果证明；不同研究间结果存在冲突（如A. muciniphila）。",
        "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物组影响ICIs疗效的具体微生物物种（如Akkermansia, Bifidobacterium, Lactobacillus, Fusobacterium）及其在MSS/pMMR CRC中的临床前和初步临床证据。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
