      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::9a8c8c84055f2f5ec45e2efd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9a8c8c84055f2f5ec45e2efd",
      "source_handle": "P0008",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管成人研究中微生物组对肿瘤免疫治疗的影响已较明确，但在儿科人群中，由于病例数少和治疗复杂，其具体作用、对疗效的影响机制以及对副作用的贡献仍不清楚。本文旨在梳理现有文献，填补这一知识空白。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b9dc603c11ee193c68e27ba99a21eecc233485dce2740f45527209f089d28f6d",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::cb088844c6a47ac6f5d76de6bb6622123bc271f9ce9b38feb916671f89a9fd8d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::5698c6861547b14b692a5ea1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::5698c6861547b14b692a5ea1",
      "source_handle": "P0008",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "儿科肿瘤（特别是急性淋巴细胞白血病和实体瘤）与肠道微生物组的关系，涵盖发病机制、治疗反应及副作用。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b9dc603c11ee193c68e27ba99a21eecc233485dce2740f45527209f089d28f6d",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c931785a572d5076d801297f140b45c2a4409a95fd590b559c243d55aaa3174f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::fa48e8593af165fb2b6abbf5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fa48e8593af165fb2b6abbf5",
      "source_handle": "P0008",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "这是一篇2022年的综述文章，旨在总结肠道微生物组在儿科肿瘤发生和治疗中的最新研究进展。文章首先概述了微生物组的一般生理作用及其通过免疫调节影响癌症的机制，随后重点讨论了儿科特异性，包括分娩方式、喂养方式对微生物组的影响，以及化疗和放疗引起的微生物组变化。研究发现，微生物组的变化与治疗反应和毒性相关，但目前证据多来自成人或小型儿科队列，且因果关系尚不明确。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b9dc603c11ee193c68e27ba99a21eecc233485dce2740f45527209f089d28f6d",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::004aa6f4a5f32f88cdb2b6342ade15973bcf066496f2fcbfdc0e5c06a259977a",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::27021dceb70692ec254a2259": {
      "atom_id": "atom::27021dceb70692ec254a2259",
      "source_handle": "P0008",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述提供了儿科肿瘤中微生物组作用的宏观背景和具体临床关联素材。虽然它不直接回答“机制”层面的分子细节（这是其局限），但它提供了关键的临床表型关联（如菌群变化与疗效/毒性的相关性）、不同肿瘤类型的证据强度对比（ALL vs 实体瘤），以及关于抗生素使用对免疫治疗影响的成人证据外推提示。对于综述而言，它是构建“儿科特异性”章节和讨论“当前证据局限性”的重要基础材料。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b9dc603c11ee193c68e27ba99a21eecc233485dce2740f45527209f089d28f6d",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::24d3bd7578a0cceee88e7021bea95be3a339e58f5c724b736500c17ff4077c11",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::16e154198afee70b84b0d829": {
      "atom_id": "atom::16e154198afee70b84b0d829",
      "source_handle": "P0008",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "该综述明确指出儿科实体瘤数据极少，且多数关联未证实因果。不能将此视为儿科ICIs疗效的确切机制解释，仅作为假设生成的来源。",
        "contribution": "提供了儿科肿瘤中微生物组与治疗反应关联的临床观察数据。例如，指出ALL患者化疗后多样性降低，且某些菌群丰度变化与疗效相关（尽管主要是描述性关联）。同时引用了成人研究中Akkermansia与ICIs疗效正相关的证据，为儿科可能的类似机制提供类比支持。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b9dc603c11ee193c68e27ba99a21eecc233485dce2740f45527209f089d28f6d",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5bfffaef26853aa76704e252c2aed8b82c8d980e35845e1d6436b24fe4221d70",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::9b85b7cc6d883884e1e91961": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9b85b7cc6d883884e1e91961",
      "source_handle": "P0008",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于回答“微生物组如何调节ICIs疗效”中的临床现象部分，特别是说明目前儿科直接证据不足，需参考成人数据并指出差异。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b9dc603c11ee193c68e27ba99a21eecc233485dce2740f45527209f089d28f6d",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::980ac42ef0554ecc3d6a9f674cafa615c4da2ed389459bd772d74edab282330d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::9bda68f2ddae3b446d9d8f89": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9bda68f2ddae3b446d9d8f89",
      "source_handle": "P0008",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这些机制大多基于成人模型或体外研究，儿科特异性验证不足。综述本身未提供新的机制实验数据，而是汇总现有理论。",
        "contribution": "概述了微生物组影响治疗的潜在生物学途径，包括：1）细菌酶解药物代谢（如伊立替康）；2）免疫调节（如双歧杆菌促进T细胞反应）；3）屏障损伤导致细菌易位引发炎症。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b9dc603c11ee193c68e27ba99a21eecc233485dce2740f45527209f089d28f6d",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5bfffaef26853aa76704e252c2aed8b82c8d980e35845e1d6436b24fe4221d70",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::87bb20646d424ea3a6c7bae8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::87bb20646d424ea3a6c7bae8",
      "source_handle": "P0008",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于回答“介导效应的机制”，提供理论框架和已知的成人机制案例，帮助理解儿科环境中可能存在的类似通路。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::b9dc603c11ee193c68e27ba99a21eecc233485dce2740f45527209f089d28f6d",
          "field_path": [
