    },
    "atom::dfb23f0ab88414ec82177b23": {
      "atom_id": "atom::dfb23f0ab88414ec82177b23",
      "source_handle": "P0484",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "随着人口老龄化，老年癌症患者在接受新兴的免疫疗法时往往缺乏代表性数据。已知衰老会导致微生物组发生已知转变，但这些转变如何影响ICIs疗效？特别是，衰老引起的微生物组变化是否导致了该人群疗效降低？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5567ffc9b009ab7b1339d559a794b430029bd320533097a3d87ab69416517629",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::dd99c3c2815bb26f94cf34a66c93b8f882fdff0c52661e3d3e0d4d279000073f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::dba6e9c1035507d6509ff592": {
      "atom_id": "atom::dba6e9c1035507d6509ff592",
      "source_handle": "P0484",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "老年癌症患者、肠道微生物组、免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）疗效",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5567ffc9b009ab7b1339d559a794b430029bd320533097a3d87ab69416517629",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3edb9f8ae55599564823ed03c6d184b841bcc7d38c581df36d57400d5bd70bff",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::4270f4bc1c3973a0df4a4095": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4270f4bc1c3973a0df4a4095",
      "source_handle": "P0484",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇综述，旨在探讨肠道微生物组随年龄变化的特征及其对老年癌症患者接受免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）治疗反应的影响。文章总结了与衰老相关的微生物变化文献，并将其置于ICIs疗效的背景下进行解读，提出了一种解释这些广泛变化的模型，并讨论了针对这一未被充分研究人群的临床试验现状。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5567ffc9b009ab7b1339d559a794b430029bd320533097a3d87ab69416517629",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a0882d9d8572765cfa0bf53e3ec0f3f7def5945afb468b9aac58c4ffe17b77d7",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::70a25591cd37a6e5c9bad9d7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::70a25591cd37a6e5c9bad9d7",
      "source_handle": "P0484",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为理解老年癌症患者ICIs疗效差异提供了一个重要的微生物组学视角。它直接关联了“衰老”这一宿主因素与“微生物组”这一环境/共生因素，解释了为何老年人群可能对ICIs反应较差。对于综述而言，它是连接宿主年龄、微生物组构成与治疗结局的关键桥梁，特别适用于解释疗效异质性中的宿主-微生物交互作用部分。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5567ffc9b009ab7b1339d559a794b430029bd320533097a3d87ab69416517629",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::d0c7331e7e354f6823d94c8ad6a6089d6cb96deadea258284365c33c79e71efe",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::3a12281019419049fa737cd8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3a12281019419049fa737cd8",
      "source_handle": "P0484",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这是基于文献总结的推论，非直接干预实验结果。未提供具体的微生物物种名称或丰度数据，无法用于定量预测。",
        "contribution": "提供了关于老年人群微生物组组成趋向于“无响应者”特征的定性描述。指出这种组成缺乏支持ICIs疗效的微生物，从而解释了该人群疗效降低的可能原因。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5567ffc9b009ab7b1339d559a794b430029bd320533097a3d87ab69416517629",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5956d1043cddab053dc1ea5b942ba7fa1dcc77c139d17dd719726ff19d17c141",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d7c0912c47e507759c841273": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d7c0912c47e507759c841273",
      "source_handle": "P0484",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可用于解释为什么老年患者在ICIs治疗中反应率较低，作为疗效差异的背景因素之一。帮助建立“年龄-微生物组-疗效”的逻辑链条。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5567ffc9b009ab7b1339d559a794b430029bd320533097a3d87ab69416517629",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::374964f7cabacc187ab5d1059e941c8ea877e2ab2655c534e67aab86ce9cc474",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::09ea2d04b82d833ef20840b9": {
      "atom_id": "atom::09ea2d04b82d833ef20840b9",
      "source_handle": "P0484",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "摘要中称“review the potential mechanisms... and posit a model”，但未列出具体机制路径（如炎症、代谢产物等）。因此只能作为机制探索的指引，不能替代具体的机制证据。",
        "contribution": "回顾了衰老引起微生物组变化的潜在机制，并提出了一个解释这些变化的概念模型。虽然具体机制细节在摘要中未展开，但指出了方向：衰老导致的微生物组改变可能介导了疗效差异。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::5567ffc9b009ab7b1339d559a794b430029bd320533097a3d87ab69416517629",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5956d1043cddab053dc1ea5b942ba7fa1dcc77c139d17dd719726ff19d17c141",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
