    },
    "atom::ff55ae9f543d103b6be31e83": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ff55ae9f543d103b6be31e83",
      "source_handle": "P0054",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "传统单一生物标志物（如PD-L1、TMB）对ICI疗效预测准确性有限，无法全面捕捉肿瘤异质性和动态免疫逃逸机制。如何利用AI整合多维多组学数据，以更精准地预测ICI响应、揭示耐药机制并指导个性化治疗？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e019bc638d7f5519719278f1c816f7c200e1a8e21b65fce45b14b857ca023898",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::aa49826e74a89c4bdaf3613a37e6677e9eeb54eea03a496082bbd450eae421f9",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::1ebcb1344cda6182f0de3e02": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1ebcb1344cda6182f0de3e02",
      "source_handle": "P0054",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）在实体瘤及血液肿瘤中的应用，重点聚焦于AI驱动的多组学整合技术。涵盖基因组、转录组、表观基因组、代谢组、微生物组、病理学和影像组学等多维度数据，旨在解决ICI疗效预测和耐药机制不明的问题。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e019bc638d7f5519719278f1c816f7c200e1a8e21b65fce45b14b857ca023898",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a4f43f29b17147db9e4476f633482019a4ddcb6e494576c4d2d0b8fc40b992cf",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::631594cd50887263f619a56f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::631594cd50887263f619a56f",
      "source_handle": "P0054",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇叙事性综述，系统梳理了人工智能与多组学技术在预测免疫检查点抑制剂响应和耐药方面的最新进展。文章首先阐述了ICI疗效差异的生物学基础，包括肿瘤异质性、干细胞特性、微环境重塑及微生物组调控；随后介绍了AI算法如何整合异构多组学数据以发现生物标志物、构建预测模型并进行患者分层；接着讨论了这些模型在指导联合治疗、实时监测和毒性预测中的临床转化潜力；最后分析了实施障碍（如数据异质性、黑盒性质、缺乏前瞻性验证）并展望了单细胞/空间多组学、联邦学习和生成式AI等未来方向。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e019bc638d7f5519719278f1c816f7c200e1a8e21b65fce45b14b857ca023898",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::f23e6e617d82572cad2c4e41548e6422b1db3eca20335691d9362f4d79b1b81d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::426e08a68a7581bf4fd33ed9": {
      "atom_id": "atom::426e08a68a7581bf4fd33ed9",
      "source_handle": "P0054",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为理解肠道微生物组如何调节实体瘤中ICI疗效提供了丰富的背景信息和机制线索。它汇总了微生物组特征（如特定菌属丰度、抗生素影响）与ICI响应之间的关联，并指出了AI在解析这种关联中的作用。虽然它不直接提供因果证据，但为综述中关于“微生物组调节机制”的部分提供了关键的假设来源和现有研究的概览，特别是关于菌群失调导致耐药的观察性证据。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e019bc638d7f5519719278f1c816f7c200e1a8e21b65fce45b14b857ca023898",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::086a354b25432097d6a582affa76c596170404ad6431bf819b229d48992eeac3",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::1e3ef3ec2ff1e21321a4b09f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1e3ef3ec2ff1e21321a4b09f",
      "source_handle": "P0054",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅为相关性观察，未证明因果关系；主要基于回顾性队列和小型干预研究，外推至所有实体瘤需谨慎。",
        "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物组组成（如Bacteroides, Prevotella）与ICI响应之间关联的观察性证据，以及抗生素使用对疗效的负面影响。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e019bc638d7f5519719278f1c816f7c200e1a8e21b65fce45b14b857ca023898",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3c53384f5ec3ecac82f45fbb8d0e382a07e09b532aa95f996734ccfe183b12d3",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::0b812c2ce2ae1e291048f9e3": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0b812c2ce2ae1e291048f9e3",
      "source_handle": "P0054",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可用于回答“肠道微生物组如何调节ICI疗效”中的描述性问题，即哪些微生物特征与疗效相关。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e019bc638d7f5519719278f1c816f7c200e1a8e21b65fce45b14b857ca023898",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a30eb0e6538128abd37599924ae73a3193e7060876c0e33cb719d47b7a94aa57",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::82748b8529f7768537d88a94": {
      "atom_id": "atom::82748b8529f7768537d88a94",
      "source_handle": "P0054",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "机制多为推测性或基于动物/小样本研究，缺乏在大样本人群中验证的详细分子通路证据；具体介导分子（如短链脂肪酸的具体作用）需结合其他原始研究确认。",
        "contribution": "提出了微生物组通过调节全身免疫状态（如T细胞活性）和代谢产物影响ICI疗效的潜在机制，并指出FMT可能作为一种干预手段。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e019bc638d7f5519719278f1c816f7c200e1a8e21b65fce45b14b857ca023898",
          "field_path": [
