    },
    "atom::225847e797c5848ab97bbe8b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::225847e797c5848ab97bbe8b",
      "source_handle": "P0574",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "作为一篇综述，本文采用了概念框架梳理与实证研究综合相结合的方法。首先，从宿主内在因素（年龄、性别、遗传）和外在因素（地理、生活方式、饮食、药物、疾病状态）多维度界定“健康”与“失调”的复杂性。其次，系统评估了用于检测和量化菌群失调的工具箱，包括粪便/血清生物标志物（如钙卫蛋白、SCFA、胆汁酸、sMAdCAM-1）、传统多样性指标、肠型、微生物群落（guilds）以及基于机器学习的多组学评分模型（重点介绍TOPOSCORE）。最后，综合了关于菌群失调干扰免疫通路（如胆汁酸代谢、屏障功能、T细胞 trafficking）的机制证据，并总结了正在进行的临床试验和国际合作倡议（ONCOBIOME）。文中引用了大量已发表的研究结果进行论证，而非报告新的独立实验数据。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::02aa3423f2b131c82d487a6ee41c4f5548dc31e2279f9d66f2286b7ae44a70d3",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::105ae89e9fc58d1e9a9e4b5041a7cc082522bd6a4740f5704249fe1688cdee4b",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::e6b4ec3536bfed5569957e0a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e6b4ec3536bfed5569957e0a",
      "source_handle": "P0574",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提出了一个整合性的框架，将菌群失调定义为生态韧性/抵抗力的破坏，而非简单的多样性丧失。引入了TOPOSCORE这一具体的、基于机器学习且可床旁转化的评分工具，用于个体化评估菌群失调程度。",
        "limits": "所给摘要未交代该综述是否进行了严格的文献质量评估或系统性检索流程。TOPOSCORE虽经回顾性验证，但 prospective validation（前瞻性验证）仍在进行中，其普适性需进一步确认。部分机制（如特定菌株的作用）主要基于动物模型或观察性研究，因果链条在人类中尚未完全确立。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::02aa3423f2b131c82d487a6ee41c4f5548dc31e2279f9d66f2286b7ae44a70d3",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e8a3b75618464ace332a065eabe8295b2d0edccfe03d13c5c3b7b5fa618d7c43",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::200c001346fd8431eea9af0a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::200c001346fd8431eea9af0a",
      "source_handle": "P0574",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "跨多种癌症类型（NSCLC, RCC, UC, CRC）及健康对照的宏基因组数据分析",
        "finding": "识别出两个拮抗的物种相互作用组（SIGs）：SIG1（含37种菌，与较差生存期相关，包括口腔来源菌和产胆汁酸厌氧菌）和SIG2（含45种菌，与较好预后相关，主要为丁酸盐产生菌）。TOPOSCORE基于SIG1/SIG2比例计算，能有效预测ICI疗效。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::02aa3423f2b131c82d487a6ee41c4f5548dc31e2279f9d66f2286b7ae44a70d3",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::547cbab435db53f976a59e5e648f60fd97579471b09e9f9e84b673c91a6a88bd",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::e8cd3bc0897a301a1d370642": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e8cd3bc0897a301a1d370642",
      "source_handle": "P0574",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "不同宿主和环境因素对肠道微生物的影响",
        "finding": "年龄、性别、遗传、地理、饮食和药物均显著塑造微生物组。其中，药物（特别是抗生素、PPIs）和饮食是主要的可调节驱动因素。抗生素使用与ICI治疗后的无进展生存期和总生存期缩短相关。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::02aa3423f2b131c82d487a6ee41c4f5548dc31e2279f9d66f2286b7ae44a70d3",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::547cbab435db53f976a59e5e648f60fd97579471b09e9f9e84b673c91a6a88bd",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c8bfa4f0c1c8726428d0c9a5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c8bfa4f0c1c8726428d0c9a5",
      "source_handle": "P0574",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "菌群失调对免疫系统的机制性影响",
        "finding": "菌群失调通过多种途径影响免疫：1) 胆汁酸代谢改变导致MAdCAM-1下调，促进抑制性Tr17细胞迁移至肿瘤；2) 肠道屏障受损导致内毒素血症和全身炎症；3) 色氨酸代谢异常影响T细胞活性。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::02aa3423f2b131c82d487a6ee41c4f5548dc31e2279f9d66f2286b7ae44a70d3",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::547cbab435db53f976a59e5e648f60fd97579471b09e9f9e84b673c91a6a88bd",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::1e3908ba4f68f0fdec14c7bd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1e3908ba4f68f0fdec14c7bd",
      "source_handle": "P0574",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "生物标志物的临床应用潜力",
        "finding": "sMAdCAM-1被提出作为癌症患者菌群失调的“肠道检查”生物标志物，低水平预示较差结局。粪便和血清中的代谢物（SCFA, BA, LPS衍生物）可作为功能性失调的指标。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::02aa3423f2b131c82d487a6ee41c4f5548dc31e2279f9d66f2286b7ae44a70d3",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::547cbab435db53f976a59e5e648f60fd97579471b09e9f9e84b673c91a6a88bd",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::0520404a962eeeeb652448cc": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0520404a962eeeeb652448cc",
      "source_handle": "P0574",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "paper_kind"
      ],
      "value": "review",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::02aa3423f2b131c82d487a6ee41c4f5548dc31e2279f9d66f2286b7ae44a70d3",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::ea19859b75dd17bf9654d29e92be2da2624af3a272fc658d721916430e1b673f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::abd31b01ef7c997eae560a3a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::abd31b01ef7c997eae560a3a",
      "source_handle": "P0574",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "当前微生物组科学向临床转化的主要障碍是什么？如何更准确地定义和测量肿瘤治疗中的“菌群失调”，以及其背后的机制和干预手段有哪些？",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::02aa3423f2b131c82d487a6ee41c4f5548dc31e2279f9d66f2286b7ae44a70d3",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0be629d990587698966aa22abb56e63deff8de0df11fe6d1dd323441cabddcca",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::a011da2fafed15a190fa0d42": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a011da2fafed15a190fa0d42",
      "source_handle": "P0574",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "肿瘤学背景下的肠道微生物组，特别是其与免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效及耐药性的关系；涵盖定义、生物标志物、机制及干预策略。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::02aa3423f2b131c82d487a6ee41c4f5548dc31e2279f9d66f2286b7ae44a70d3",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b294953154fee7f89c57c3abdd8f9bd91c45a98326244b35f5b122d016ac6072",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::ea0ab8e9068f33e190fdea70": {
      "atom_id": "atom::ea0ab8e9068f33e190fdea70",
      "source_handle": "P0574",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "这是一篇综述论文，旨在解决肠道微生物组在临床转化中因“菌群失调”定义不一致、生物标志物框架不足及机制理解有限而面临的障碍。文章综合了现有知识，阐述了肠道微生物组成和功能如何影响ICI疗效，区分了相关性与因果证据。作者讨论了基于α-多样性或分类丰度的计算方法，并主张采用更具功能和临床信息量的模型（如TOPOSCORE）。通过回顾性分析数千名患者和对照组的宏基因组数据，研究了区分响应者和非响应者的微生物模式。此外，探讨了菌群失调如何干扰免疫调节通路（如胆汁酸代谢、肠道通透性和黏膜免疫调节），评估了纠正微生物功能障碍的 emerging 治疗策略（饮食、细菌联合体、FMT），并介绍了ONCOBIOME倡议及其全球Atlas平台。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::02aa3423f2b131c82d487a6ee41c4f5548dc31e2279f9d66f2286b7ae44a70d3",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::18085cad326700e6a4d8680fe78ea761001560821fe0833816c4d815e31cd4fc",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::507d7c5b52fb8f5862d91d0f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::507d7c5b52fb8f5862d91d0f",
      "source_handle": "P0574",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为理解肠道微生物组如何调节实体瘤中ICI疗效提供了全面的机制背景和临床转化视角。它特别有价值地提供了关于“菌群失调”多维定义的证据，详细列举了关键的生物标志物（特别是sMAdCAM-1和代谢物），并深入解析了胆汁酸代谢、屏障功能和T细胞迁移等具体机制。此外，它还提供了关于微生物群落在ICI响应中的动态变化（SIGs）以及ONCOBIOME等大型倡议的最新进展，有助于构建综述中关于机制复杂性和临床挑战的部分。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::02aa3423f2b131c82d487a6ee41c4f5548dc31e2279f9d66f2286b7ae44a70d3",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::85e2d146337c7c89cbf4521261a14ce8268eb3d247fa3129aaa5631b0ba8e2b2",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::663d7149925b6ae8ef095827": {
      "atom_id": "atom::663d7149925b6ae8ef095827",
      "source_handle": "P0574",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "主要基于回顾性分析和已发表的临床试验数据，因果关系需结合其他研究确认。不同癌种的微生物特征可能存在差异。",
        "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物组特征（如SIG1富集、低多样性、特定菌属缺失）与ICI疗效（响应vs非响应）之间的关联证据。指出了微生物组构成随时间变化的动态性，以及基线多样性不足以预测长期疗效，强调了纵向稳定性和功能群的重要性。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::02aa3423f2b131c82d487a6ee41c4f5548dc31e2279f9d66f2286b7ae44a70d3",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2943c8377820cc7ab450b57093820d318ab23637bfd24573d613338861beec79",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::e992305137f13c661a146025": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e992305137f13c661a146025",
      "source_handle": "P0574",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于回答“肠道微生物组如何调节ICI疗效”中的相关性部分，提供具体的微生物特征作为疗效预测因子。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::02aa3423f2b131c82d487a6ee41c4f5548dc31e2279f9d66f2286b7ae44a70d3",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::98a0edae68d290db33f0985afe17b45726825f4a00de03613ff82f0b45a06fe9",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::89a7d1fe76dc83b7726264ec": {
      "atom_id": "atom::89a7d1fe76dc83b7726264ec",
      "source_handle": "P0574",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "许多机制细节来自小鼠模型或体外研究，在人体内的确切作用强度和普遍性尚待更多临床验证。某些机制（如TMAO的作用）具有情境依赖性。",
        "contribution": "详细阐述了菌群失调影响ICI疗效的具体机制路径：1) 胆汁酸代谢异常导致MAdCAM-1表达降低，进而允许抑制性Treg17细胞从肠道迁移至肿瘤微环境；2) 肠道屏障受损导致内毒素（LPS）易位，引发全身炎症和免疫抑制；3) 色氨酸代谢产物对T细胞活性的调节。还提到了Akkermansia muciniphila的双刃剑效应（适量有益，过量或缺失可能有害）。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::02aa3423f2b131c82d487a6ee41c4f5548dc31e2279f9d66f2286b7ae44a70d3",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2943c8377820cc7ab450b57093820d318ab23637bfd24573d613338861beec79",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::39f1afc332357b1c7af70e55": {
      "atom_id": "atom::39f1afc332357b1c7af70e55",
