    "atom::10e139f5f677d422d737fbbd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::10e139f5f677d422d737fbbd",
      "source_handle": "P0555",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "本研究采用系统性文献综述的方法。作者综合了来自不同身体部位（肠道、肺、皮肤、肿瘤内）的微生物群与PD-1/PD-L1轴相互作用的现有证据。分析路线包括：1）归纳微生物群对肿瘤微环境（TME）免疫组成的整体调节作用；2）详细解析微生物群通过代谢物（如丁酸盐、3HB、琥珀酸等）和特定菌种成分调节PD-1/PD-L1表达的分子机制；3）整理临床前和临床研究数据，识别与ICIs疗效相关的微生物特征和代谢物；4）评估基于微生物群的干预策略（如益生菌、FMT、饮食调整）在克服耐药性方面的潜力；5）批判性地讨论从动物模型到人类临床应用的转化障碍，包括个体异质性、因果关系的确定及技术标准化问题。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9d6752483bee6d7741694b722ecf47186cc6e16922d9962fbd38123f308151ac",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::39a95882b85a33d3bd59e628efa13c7bba0f5c0aa48094a3441040dda67e3ce4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::9fcc16f89c647f379abc1903": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9fcc16f89c647f379abc1903",
      "source_handle": "P0555",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了关于微生物群与PD-1/PD-L1轴相互作用的全面机制图谱，特别强调了代谢物（如丁酸盐、3HB、琥珀酸）和特定菌种在表观遗传和信号通路层面的具体调节作用。",
        "limits": "作为综述，其结论依赖于已发表研究的汇总，本身不提供新的实验数据。对于许多关联发现，因果机制尚未完全阐明，且不同研究间的结果存在矛盾（如丁酸盐的双重作用）。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9d6752483bee6d7741694b722ecf47186cc6e16922d9962fbd38123f308151ac",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7b83b7e385368aa552d897a2c736ef2c02d05b6a740442b47896f86adf829dcf",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c1ca9b249118e925840f654e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c1ca9b249118e925840f654e",
      "source_handle": "P0555",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "识别并分类了多种潜在的微生物生物标志物（如Akkermansia, F. nucleatum）和代谢物，用于预测ICIs疗效和耐药性。",
        "limits": "这些生物标志物的临床验证大多处于早期阶段，缺乏大规模前瞻性随机对照试验的支持，且受癌症类型、地理环境和基线菌群差异的影响较大。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9d6752483bee6d7741694b722ecf47186cc6e16922d9962fbd38123f308151ac",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7b83b7e385368aa552d897a2c736ef2c02d05b6a740442b47896f86adf829dcf",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::684c9b565f259d602eba5461": {
      "atom_id": "atom::684c9b565f259d602eba5461",
      "source_handle": "P0555",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "批判性地分析了从临床前到临床转化的障碍，指出了个体异质性、技术标准化缺失和还原论局限性等关键问题。",
        "limits": "提出的解决方案（如多组学整合、标准化协议）多为建议性质，尚未形成统一的临床实践指南。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9d6752483bee6d7741694b722ecf47186cc6e16922d9962fbd38123f308151ac",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7b83b7e385368aa552d897a2c736ef2c02d05b6a740442b47896f86adf829dcf",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::5917b8a38170732f7e367ff0": {
      "atom_id": "atom::5917b8a38170732f7e367ff0",
      "source_handle": "P0555",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "肠道微生物群产生的短链脂肪酸（如丁酸盐），在CD8+ T细胞中",
        "finding": "通过增强组蛋白H3K27乙酰化，上调PDCD1（PD-1）和CD28启动子活性，从而增强抗PD-1治疗的疗效；但在某些情况下也可能促进Treg分化或上调PD-L1，表现出情境依赖性。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9d6752483bee6d7741694b722ecf47186cc6e16922d9962fbd38123f308151ac",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::323180511edd3d17527a94ce4650255663fd5abc7183a05c2ff7babc0640411c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::fc6dec01a037bdbbb85c8d39": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fc6dec01a037bdbbb85c8d39",
      "source_handle": "P0555",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "特定有益菌（如双歧杆菌、阿克曼氏菌、普拉梭菌）",
        "finding": "能够促进效应T细胞（如CD8+ CTLs）的浸润和活化，下调PD-1/PD-L1表达或抑制免疫抑制性细胞（如MDSCs、Tregs），从而提高ICIs疗效。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9d6752483bee6d7741694b722ecf47186cc6e16922d9962fbd38123f308151ac",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::323180511edd3d17527a94ce4650255663fd5abc7183a05c2ff7babc0640411c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::51b837148cb6605bfee39d6d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::51b837148cb6605bfee39d6d",
      "source_handle": "P0555",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "耐药相关菌（如具核梭杆菌 Fusobacterium nucleatum）及其代谢物（琥珀酸）",
        "finding": "通过抑制cGAS-STING信号通路，阻碍CD8+ T细胞向肿瘤微环境的浸润，导致对PD-1抑制剂产生耐药性。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9d6752483bee6d7741694b722ecf47186cc6e16922d9962fbd38123f308151ac",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::323180511edd3d17527a94ce4650255663fd5abc7183a05c2ff7babc0640411c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::d2bd22b68a3399b73dd7b0e5": {
      "atom_id": "atom::d2bd22b68a3399b73dd7b0e5",
      "source_handle": "P0555",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "非肠道微生物群（如肺癌中的曲霉菌、胃癌中的具核梭杆菌）",
        "finding": "可直接在肿瘤局部招募免疫抑制细胞或激活特定信号通路（如IL-17/NF-κB），诱导PD-L1表达，独立于肠道菌群发挥作用。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9d6752483bee6d7741694b722ecf47186cc6e16922d9962fbd38123f308151ac",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "3"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::323180511edd3d17527a94ce4650255663fd5abc7183a05c2ff7babc0640411c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::9bffca20f21270e48e01cb82": {
      "atom_id": "atom::9bffca20f21270e48e01cb82",
      "source_handle": "P0555",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "临床前小鼠模型与人类临床试验之间",
        "finding": "存在显著的“转化鸿沟”。小鼠模型通常使用无菌或标准化菌群，而人类菌群具有高度异质性；单一菌株在小鼠中有效，在人类中效果往往不一致，且因果关系的确立仍面临挑战。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9d6752483bee6d7741694b722ecf47186cc6e16922d9962fbd38123f308151ac",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "4"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::323180511edd3d17527a94ce4650255663fd5abc7183a05c2ff7babc0640411c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::0ce18e5c45064096867cbbca": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0ce18e5c45064096867cbbca",
      "source_handle": "P0555",
      "field_path": [
