      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::5f5a0a6271c126fd097707cf": {
      "atom_id": "atom::5f5a0a6271c126fd097707cf",
      "source_handle": "P0555",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管PD-1/PD-L1阻断疗法在多种癌症中取得了显著成效，但患者反应差异巨大且存在耐药性问题。现有研究提示微生物群可能在这一过程中起关键作用，但微生物群具体通过何种机制影响PD-1/PD-L1轴，以及如何利用这一知识优化临床治疗，尚需系统整合。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9d6752483bee6d7741694b722ecf47186cc6e16922d9962fbd38123f308151ac",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::52aec9a7bac4e33e909d319fc77d2d36d5d916a495db9e86ea07142b5762ca42",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::3580e3b096e68b9c7ebfd6a1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3580e3b096e68b9c7ebfd6a1",
      "source_handle": "P0555",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "该综述的研究对象为微生物群（特别是肠道微生物群，同时也涵盖肺、皮肤及肿瘤内微生物群）与PD-1/PD-L1免疫检查点轴在实体瘤免疫治疗中的相互作用。研究范围涵盖了从基础机制（代谢物、信号通路、免疫细胞调节）到临床转化（生物标志物、耐药性克服、FMT等干预措施）的广泛领域。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9d6752483bee6d7741694b722ecf47186cc6e16922d9962fbd38123f308151ac",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::9cf3ce7ae7d85ebce3bcd22efe559c5fead6674ec17117b1330c09617732565f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::f00b0b146b1ee560017d73a8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f00b0b146b1ee560017d73a8",
      "source_handle": "P0555",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇2025年发表的综述，旨在系统梳理微生物群如何影响PD-1/PD-L1介导的肿瘤免疫逃逸及免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）的治疗疗效。文章首先阐述了微生物群通过直接相互作用和产生代谢物（如短链脂肪酸SCFAs）调节宿主免疫系统的基础作用；随后深入探讨了微生物群调控PD-1/PD-L1表达的具体分子机制，包括表观遗传修饰、受体配体相互作用及信号通路激活；接着总结了特定微生物菌种及其代谢物作为预测生物标志物和克服ICIs耐药性的策略；最后讨论了非肠道微生物群的作用以及从临床前模型向临床应用转化的挑战与前景。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9d6752483bee6d7741694b722ecf47186cc6e16922d9962fbd38123f308151ac",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::5fd3b9c3ada1449ddfc90ffb28fc4b3d64e5443c347dd92f68cddbdcddfa4c68",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::2a948dceaedcb0ea1fb36c0e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2a948dceaedcb0ea1fb36c0e",
      "source_handle": "P0555",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为理解肠道及非肠道微生物群如何调节PD-1/PD-L1免疫检查点功能提供了详细的机制背景和临床关联素材。它特别适用于解释微生物群影响ICIs疗效的具体分子路径（如代谢物介导的表观遗传调控、特定菌种引发的免疫细胞重编程），以及列举具体的微生物/代谢物作为疗效预测因子或耐药驱动因素。此外，它对临床转化挑战的讨论有助于在综述中构建关于研究局限性和未来方向的论述。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9d6752483bee6d7741694b722ecf47186cc6e16922d9962fbd38123f308151ac",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::b5ede1c8cd260c1fe28d9eef05ce9551eed2b56f145f7c5343cce601e51a4aa9",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::db2ee84653665b2b53d2f55f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::db2ee84653665b2b53d2f55f",
      "source_handle": "P0555",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这些关联主要基于回顾性研究和部分前瞻性队列，因果关系尚未在所有案例中得到确证。不同癌症类型（如黑色素瘤、结直肠癌、肺癌）中的优势菌种可能存在差异。",
        "contribution": "提供了肠道和非肠道微生物群影响ICIs疗效的具体微生物特征和代谢物列表。例如，指出应答者中富集 Akkermansia muciniphila, Bacteroides vulgatus, Ruminococcaceae 等，而非应答者中富集 Fusobacterium nucleatum, Bacilli 等。同时列出了具体的代谢物变化（如高丁酸盐、低琥珀酸与良好预后相关）。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9d6752483bee6d7741694b722ecf47186cc6e16922d9962fbd38123f308151ac",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e4633d7b4b04e5f733ebe1861421bd386058bd94ee63b7db4bd6b1fea219a32d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::a5bc7164c466bfa72b888dbf": {
      "atom_id": "atom::a5bc7164c466bfa72b888dbf",
      "source_handle": "P0555",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可用于回答“哪些微生物特征与ICIs疗效相关”的问题，提供具体的菌种和代谢物作为证据支持。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9d6752483bee6d7741694b722ecf47186cc6e16922d9962fbd38123f308151ac",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::336ac1be32dfb5e6dfc61f93b8f9c5275a1081e50910dd5c4b8bd71c8e3ea516",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::176439e2f2693142d1eb0ff4": {
      "atom_id": "atom::176439e2f2693142d1eb0ff4",
      "source_handle": "P0555",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "许多机制细节源自临床前小鼠模型或体外实验，其在人体内的确切适用性仍需验证。部分机制（如丁酸盐的双重作用）具有高度的情境依赖性，不能简单推广。",
        "contribution": "详细描述了微生物群调节PD-1/PD-L1轴的多种机制。包括：1）代谢物介导的表观遗传调控（如丁酸盐增强PDCD1启动子乙酰化）；2）代谢物直接结合DNA调控转录（如DHA拮抗c-Myc抑制PD-L1转录）；3）通过免疫细胞表面受体信号通路（如TLR4-NF-κB, PD-L2-RGMb）调节；4）通过抑制或激活特定信号通路（如cGAS-STING, Wnt/β-catenin）影响免疫细胞浸润和功能。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9d6752483bee6d7741694b722ecf47186cc6e16922d9962fbd38123f308151ac",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e4633d7b4b04e5f733ebe1861421bd386058bd94ee63b7db4bd6b1fea219a32d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::741aa89e8d6ea0e9143b4922": {
