        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该综述涵盖多种癌症类型（肺癌、结直肠癌、黑色素瘤等），不同癌种中微生物群的作用可能不同，使用时需注意癌症类型的特异性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9d6752483bee6d7741694b722ecf47186cc6e16922d9962fbd38123f308151ac",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::889453d4a2742dbd1afdc94116ae11ba01e4253ea84aefac52d1405a1de13547",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::cb3c867e9da45ab021a0c322": {
      "atom_id": "atom::cb3c867e9da45ab021a0c322",
      "source_handle": "P0555",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "文中提到的许多机制（如丁酸盐的双刃剑效应）具有高度的情境依赖性，取决于肿瘤微环境、细胞因子谱和宿主状态，不能一概而论。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::9d6752483bee6d7741694b722ecf47186cc6e16922d9962fbd38123f308151ac",
